OL,3,ALegal bid to overturn Drumcree march
OL,4,Aban fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempt to overturn the Northern
OL,7,FIreland secretary's decision to ban the
OL,8,FDrumcree parade has failed.
OL,10,FThe High Court in Belfast has ruled
OL,11,Fthat Sir Chris Bryant's decision made
OL,12,Fon 9 October was lawful.
OL,14,FThe judicial review was brought by a
OL,15,FPortadown Orangeman against Sir Chris
OL,16,Fand the Police Service of Northern
OL,17,FIreland (PSNI) Chief Constable Jon
OL,18,FBoutcher.
OL,20,FThe secretary of state's intervention
OL,21,Fto stop the parade came after he
OL,22,Freceived security advice from Boutcher.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
